### 1. GET all Bills
GET http://localhost:8080/bills
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET a single Bill by ID (Grabbing Bill #1)
GET http://localhost:8080/bills/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST a new Bill (Create)
POST http://localhost:8080/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payeeName": "NAIT",
  "paymentDue": 85.50,
  "dueDate": "2026-05-15",
  "paid": false
}

### 4. PUT an existing Bill (Update Bill #1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/bills/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payeeName": "Updated Payee Name",
  "paymentDue": 999.99,
  "dueDate": "2026-06-01",
  "paid": true
}

### 5. DELETE a Bill (Delete Bill #2)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bills/2